  (text "OpenKNX BCU Connector. Only VCC2 5V \nis used. The 3V3 in this schematic will \nnot be used. XIAO is powered with 5V \nsupply via 5V-PIN. \n\nThe XIAO built-in DC-DC converter circuit \nis able to change 5V voltage into 3.3V."
