  (text "Pin SAVE This pin is an open drain output with internal \npull-up resistor to VIF. In case of break-down of the bus \nvoltage for more than typ. 1.5 ms (save condition) this \npin delivers an active LOW signal to external host electronic.\n\nBridge: Optional. Only valid, when used by Software."
    (at 155.6512 36.068 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 771c6326-0d96-439d-aee6-9a699ee9dc0b)
